    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02882",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这天共进行了九手。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Nine moves were played in all that day.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02882",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "大竹七段下黑99时，已到约定的封盘时间十二点半，就决定后边由七段独自去思考。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When Otake, 7-dan, played Black 99, it was already the agreed sealing time of twelve thirty, so it was decided that he would think over the next move on his own.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02882",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "名人离开了棋盘。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Meijin left the board.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02882",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "这时，才听见欢声笑语。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Only then could voices of delight and laughter be heard.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
